  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.28 - Tighten fixer actions to avoid unsafe automatic rewrites\n\n            Changed:\n            - Hardened AM031's redundant-`ForMember` removal code fix so it only appears for direct convention-equivalent `MapFrom(src => src.Member)` mappings; transformed expressions, captured values, and other mapping policy keep the manual-review action\n            - Hardened AM001 so unrelated reference/framework conversions such as `Uri` to `string` do not receive speculative cast actions\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 with targeted AM001 and AM031 code-fix coverage\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR CI/CD and Claude Code Review passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.27 - Lock AM041 ForPath chained-configuration withhold behavior with a direct test",
